Here is a hint for neophyte genocidal maniacs:    ;^)

*always* check the cursed/blessed state of these scrolls before reading them.

A blessed genocide will forever eliminate from your current game the entire
character class that you name.

An uncursed genocide will eliminate a single species, ie mordor orcs.

A cursed genocide will *summon* a whole room-full of whatever creature you
name.  If you want to do the nurse scam you have to have a *cursed* scroll.
If you want to eliminate all Liches or all demons you have to have a *blessed*
scroll.

Also note - I haven't tried the nurse scam lately, so I don't even know if
it still works.  If it does still work, then make like you are ready for an
examination at your doctors office, or you might get hurt really bad.

There is danger involved in this stunt, so be prepared for eventualities.

BTW - sorry to hear of your untimely demise.  But I believe you will have
      to specifically name the nurse if that is what you want to summon a
      crowd of.  And you don't want them killed, so don't use an uncursed
      scroll on them.

